So hexadecimal mein:

54 72 79 48 61 63 6B 4D 65

Binary mein:

01010100 01110010 01111001 01001000
01100001 01100011 01101011 01001101 01100101

Computer ke liye ye basically bytes hain.

Hum ise decode karke:

