Ye must-know cheat sheet hai:
Concept	Yaad rakho
Bit	0 or 1
Byte	8 bits
ASCII	7-bit, 128 values
ASCII A	Decimal 65, Hex 41
ASCII a	Decimal 97, Hex 61
Unicode	Universal character/code-point system
A	U+0041
Ω	U+03A9
