UTF-8	1–4 bytes
UTF-16	2 or 4 bytes
UTF-32	4 bytes
⭐ Sabse important distinction

ASCII → old/smaller character encoding

Unicode → characters ko universal code points deta hai

UTF-8 → Unicode ko bytes mein encode karne ka method

UTF-16 → Unicode ko 2/4 bytes mein encode karta hai

UTF-32 → Unicode code point ko 4 bytes mein store karta hai
